{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の姉。岩瀬佑美子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/20/0282274/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は 姉さんが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までも、これからも。ずっと。ずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりもメンバー想いだったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『悲しいよゆみ姉..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦しいんだゆみ姉..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいよぉ！ゆみ姉。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう やってメンバーが泣いて迷って頼った時、姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『悲しいよなぁ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『苦しかったんだよね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『私も悔しいよ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう言ってまるで自分の事のように。一緒に泣きながら強く強く抱きしめてくれたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大丈夫だ。』って。頷いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手も小さくて。背も小さくて。足も小さい。姉さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、姉さんは誰よりも誰よりも大きな心をもっていたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は姉さんに何度も助けられたよ。本当に...ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう...ありがとう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちらは笑いのツボが似ていて、いっつも二人して突っ込み合って笑ったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっだらないことにも大笑いで。血管の話、あれ、きっと今までで一番笑ったかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出したら今でも笑えてくるよ。可笑しかったなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうさ、姉さんとの思い出書いてたらキリないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の涙にもキリがないよ.........。実は書きながらもろに号泣してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、姉さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ね、ずっとずっと姉さんのこと尊敬してたのよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごいなぁ、本当にさすがだなぁっていつも会うたびに思ってた。目で追ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追いかけていたかったよ？本音はね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりまだ寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、悩んで迷って迷って考えに考えて姉さんが決めたことだって知ってるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は 背中を押すよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい？さようなら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうや!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業は１つのことを終えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のステップに向かう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい日なんだ!!大切な時なんだ。頑張って!!って送る日なんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、姉さん??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張るから本当に頑張るから、私が身体も心も大きくなった時にまた再会してやってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもないあのやりとりが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ではかけがえないもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年後かにまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのかけがえのない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもないやりとりをしようよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、その日まで...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"瀬をはやみ 岩にせかるる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滝川の われても末に 逢わむとぞ思ふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当の意味は恋文だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の気持ちはこの和歌に近いよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして これからもよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のお姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永久不滅よ。佑美姉さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/20/0282274/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}